---
---
<section id="featured-programs" class="featured-programs section">
  <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
    <h2>專業整合．貼近人心</h2>
    <p>從臨床護理到保險顧問，結合心理學、MMT 與靈性覺察，打造最貼近人心的支持與保障。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
    <div class="isotope-layout" data-default-filter="*" data-layout="masonry" data-sort="original-order">
      <ul class="program-filters isotope-filters" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <li data-filter="*" class="filter-active">All Programs</li>
        <li data-filter=".filter-bachelor">MMT</li>
        <li data-filter=".filter-master">護理照護</li>
        <li data-filter=".filter-certificate">富邦保險</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="row g-4 isotope-container">

        <!-- 天賦11 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="program-item">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt11.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt11.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦11" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦11｜權威者】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock"></i> 4 Years</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> 120 Credits</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i> Fall &amp; Spring</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>
                    🌌 <strong>星座對應：</strong>天秤座<br />
                    🌬️ <strong>神話人物：</strong><br />
                    雅典娜（Athena）——智慧與戰略的女神<br />
                    🌟 <strong>核心特質：</strong><br />
                    📖 對知識有高度渴望，具備深厚學習力<br />
                    ⚖️ 崇尚公平與正義，擅長中立判斷<br />
                    🧠 條理清晰、擅長資訊整合與專業輸出<br />
                    🏛️ 注重制度與秩序，尊重權威也追求成為權威<br />
                    📚 內建「記事本式」的大腦，擅長記錄與規劃
                  </p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn">
                    <span>Learn More</span>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦17 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="program-item">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt17.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt17.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦17" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦17｜理想家】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock"></i> 3 Years</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> 90 Credits</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i> Fall Only</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>
                    🌌 <strong>星座對應：</strong>水瓶座<br />
                    🌬️ <strong>神話人物：</strong><br />
                    澤菲羅斯（Zephyros）——溫柔的西風之神<br />
                    🌟 <strong>核心特質：</strong><br />
                    📚 求知慾旺盛、好奇心強<br />
                    👀 觀察推測能力高<br />
                    🕊️ 崇尚自由與創意，時常走在時代前端<br />
                    🧠 具備「臨門一腳」的媒合與智慧能力<br />
                    🤝 喜歡成就他人，尋求利他價值與貢獻感
                  </p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn">
                    <span>Learn More</span>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦2 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="program-item">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt2.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt2.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦2" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦2｜敏銳者】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock"></i> 5 Years</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> 150 Credits</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i> Fall Only</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>
                    🌙 <strong>星座對應：</strong>巨蟹座<br />
                    💫 <strong>神話人物：</strong><br />
                    赫拉（Hera）——婚姻與情感的守護神<br />
                    🌟 <strong>核心特質：</strong><br />
                    💖 情感細膩、具高度共感能力<br />
                    👂 善於傾聽，能接住他人的情緒<br />
                    🌊 重視親密關係中的安全感與承諾<br />
                    🌱 在照顧他人中找到自己的價值<br />
                    🕊️ 具有溫柔而堅定的情緒支撐力量
                  </p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn">
                    <span>Learn More</span>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦19 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="program-item">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt19.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt19.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦19" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦19｜光之子】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock"></i> 5 Years</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> 150 Credits</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i> Fall Only</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>
                    ☀️ <strong>星座對應：</strong>獅子座<br />
                    🔥 <strong>神話人物：</strong><br />
                    阿波羅（Apollo）——太陽之神、藝術與預言的象徵<br />
                    🌟 <strong>核心特質：</strong><br />
                    🌞 散發光芒，擁有強烈的自我意識與影響力<br />
                    🎤 喜歡在舞台上展現自我，渴望被認可與讚賞<br />
                    🎯 極具目標感與行動力，能帶領他人往前走<br />
                    👑 天生具備領袖氣質，善於感召與鼓舞團隊<br />
                    💛 本質溫暖、正向，有療癒與感染他人的力量
                  </p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn">
                    <span>Learn More</span>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦6 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="program-item">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt6.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt6.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦6" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦6｜演譯家】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock"></i> 5 Years</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> 150 Credits</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i> Fall Only</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>
                    🌌 <strong>星座對應：</strong>雙子座<br />
                    🌬️ <strong>神話人物：</strong><br />
                    邱比特（Cupid）＆ 賽姬（Psyche）——愛與靈魂的象徵<br />
                    🌟 <strong>核心特質：</strong><br />
                    🎭 情感細膩、觀察入微，擁有高度共感力<br />
                    🗣️ 擅長語言與溝通，是天生的情緒翻譯者<br />
                    🌪️ 能讀懂他人未說出口的情緒，默默調和氣氛<br />
                    💞 在關係中渴望深度連結，時而心動，時而心碎<br />
                    🧠 遊走於理性感知與感性覺察之間，兼具理解與感受
                  </p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn">
                    <span>Learn More</span>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
